  "scope": "CodeFinder consumes owned hardware SIGTRAP signals queued behind interrupt stops before restoring banks and detaching. Real kernel queue races, target computation, console liveness, genuine SIGUSR1 and SIGSTOP/SIGCONT, original bank restoration, host CI and two ARM64 kernel profiles. Other debugger owners, arbitrary signal combinations, real ARM hardware and universal process compatibility are not certified.",
